WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.043
Whether you run one business or fifty,

00:00:03.043 --> 00:00:04.248
it feels the same.

00:00:04.248 --> 00:00:06.323
Your phone never stops buzzing,

00:00:06.323 --> 00:00:09.000
and everyone wants an answer, right now.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.037
A new lead comes in, and nobody answers.

00:00:12.037 --> 00:00:15.732
A lead that waits an hour is far less likely to reply.

00:00:15.732 --> 00:00:18.675
Three days later, they have gone elsewhere.

00:00:18.975 --> 00:00:20.620
Appointments come and go,

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.661
and nobody marks what happened.

00:00:22.661 --> 00:00:25.425
Was it a show, or a no-show? Nobody knows.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.962
The no-shows never get a call back.

00:00:27.962 --> 00:00:29.880
They just sit in the calendar,

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:30.775
and slip away.

00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:32.807
Good deals sit untouched,

00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:34.816
until they quietly turn grey,

00:00:34.816 --> 00:00:36.825
and fall out of the pipeline.

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:41.077
Meanwhile, the same contact turns up again, and again,

00:00:41.077 --> 00:00:43.200
and again, clogging your CRM.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.588
And every month, you build the reports by hand.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:47.968
You are not careless.

00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:50.925
You just cannot watch every account, all day.

00:00:51.225 --> 00:00:52.841
Then a customer comes back,

00:00:52.841 --> 00:00:55.295
and tells you something you did not know.

00:00:55.295 --> 00:00:57.450
And you find out when they tell you.

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.950
SubSync brings it all together.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.089
It connects to every business you manage,

00:01:04.089 --> 00:01:06.406
watches your leads and appointments,

00:01:06.406 --> 00:01:08.080
finds what is going wrong,

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.075
and puts a dollar figure on it.

00:01:10.575 --> 00:01:12.769
Then it shows you what to do first,

00:01:12.769 --> 00:01:15.025
with all your accounts in one place.

00:01:15.925 --> 00:01:18.046
Every morning, start with Today.

00:01:18.046 --> 00:01:21.295
It shows which connected accounts need attention,

00:01:21.295 --> 00:01:23.947
and what is at risk: about seven hundred

00:01:23.947 --> 00:01:26.002
and fifty-one thousand dollars,

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:28.124
across eighty-seven quiet deals.

00:01:28.124 --> 00:01:30.775
Below it are the accounts to save first.

00:01:30.775 --> 00:01:33.825
Open one, and you know exactly where to focus.

00:01:35.225 --> 00:01:37.321
Here is how a lead gets lost.

00:01:37.321 --> 00:01:38.694
A new lead arrives.

00:01:38.694 --> 00:01:39.778
Nobody replies.

00:01:39.778 --> 00:01:41.512
The timer keeps growing,

00:01:41.512 --> 00:01:43.825
and soon it is past your target.

00:01:44.225 --> 00:01:45.878
Speed to lead catches it.

00:01:45.878 --> 00:01:49.183
Thirteen new leads are past your target right now.

00:01:49.183 --> 00:01:51.695
Each one shows how long it has waited,

00:01:51.695 --> 00:01:53.678
so you know who to call first,

00:01:53.678 --> 00:01:55.000
