00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.302
Appointments tell the truth.

00:01:58.302 --> 00:02:00.103
Four have no outcome marked,

00:02:00.103 --> 00:02:03.063
so your real show rate is fifty-seven percent.

00:02:03.063 --> 00:02:05.766
Eight no-shows are waiting to be won back,

00:02:05.766 --> 00:02:07.052
with a list to call.

00:02:07.052 --> 00:02:09.433
And the flow tree shows which person,

00:02:09.433 --> 00:02:12.200
or which calendar, is losing your bookings.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.260
The funnel shows where every deal sits, step by step,

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:19.275
and where the biggest leak is.

00:02:19.275 --> 00:02:20.686
Replay it day by day.

00:02:20.686 --> 00:02:23.306
Click any step to open the deals there.

00:02:23.306 --> 00:02:25.858
And deals with no value still show up,

00:02:25.858 --> 00:02:27.000
